<main class="commercial"><div class="wrap"><article class="cr-detail"><p class="cr-kicker">CRANIO SYSTEMS / Practice</p><h1>What actually happens during a CRANIO session</h1><p class="cr-lead">Sessions involve work with muscles around the occiput and neck. No atlas adjustment is claimed, and this is not a substitute for medical assessment.</p><div class="cr-actions"><a class="cr-button cr-primary" href="https://wa.me/996998066098?text=Hello!%20I%20would%20like%20to%20ask%20about%20a%20CRANIO%20session%20and%20current%20fees." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-booking="whatsapp">Book via WhatsApp</a><a class="cr-button cr-outline" href="../">Back to homepage</a></div>
<section class="cr-section"><h2>Four clear stages</h2><div class="cr-steps"><div class="cr-card"><h3>Before the visit</h3><p>We discuss the main concern, duration, past injuries, limitations and warning signs that call for medical care.</p></div><div class="cr-card"><h3>Initial assessment</h3><p>We note perceived tension, neck movement and, when appropriate and agreed, standardized photos.</p></div><div class="cr-card"><h3>Percussion-assisted work</h3><p>The practitioner uses an instrument for soft-tissue work in the occipital and neck region. No vertebral adjustment is claimed.</p></div><div class="cr-card"><h3>After the session</h3><p>We compare movement and sensations, including no change or worsening, and refer for medical assessment when indicated.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="cr-section cr-split"><div><h2>What the method and instrument mean</h2></div><div><p>CRANIO combines hands-on soft-tissue work around the head and neck with observation of individual responses. The device is a percussion tool used by the practitioner; visitors do not need to purchase it.</p><p>Calibrate means recording a baseline; Determine means identifying what to observe; Optimize refers to adapting the session or habits; Verify means comparing observations. These terms do not mean medical diagnosis.</p></div></section>
<section class="cr-section cr-split"><div><h2>Indicative session pricing</h2></div><div><p>An initial session has been priced at approximately 15,000 KGS, follow-ups at 8,000 KGS and a three-session plan at 31,000 KGS. Please reconfirm fees and whether follow-up sessions are appropriate.</p><a class="cr-text-link" href="../#pricing">See prices on homepage ↗</a></div></section>
<section class="cr-section cr-safety"><h2>Safety and limitations</h2><p>CRANIO is a nonmedical practice, not a substitute for diagnosis or treatment. Sudden severe headache, numbness, weakness, speech or vision disturbances or pain after injury require urgent medical assessment. External observations do not prove C0–C1 bone displacement, and outcomes are not guaranteed.</p></section>
<section class="cr-finale"><h2>Have a question about your situation?</h2><p>Contact the practitioner to discuss the session format and availability.</p><div class="cr-actions"><a class="cr-button cr-primary" href="https://wa.me/996998066098?text=Hello!%20I%20would%20like%20to%20ask%20about%20a%20CRANIO%20session%20and%20current%20fees." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-booking="whatsapp">Message in WhatsApp</a><a class="cr-button cr-outline" href="../#safety">About safety</a></div></section></article></div></main>